<figure id="A4.T4" class="ltx_table">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 4: </span>Quantitative comparison of different baselines on pass@1 and pass@32 at the final checkpoint over three random seeds. We report mean and standard deviation in parentheses. The best mean results are in bold. Note that <math id="A4.T4.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathtt{Batch}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>𝙱𝚊𝚝𝚌𝚑</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathtt{Batch}</annotation></semantics></math> in general achieves the best final performance in terms of pass@32.</figcaption>
